      "jp": "野暮用を終えた帰り道のこと。\n草原の真ん中で日が暮れてしまい、\n明かりを持っていない僕は困り果てていた。",
      "jp_sha256": "63e0f163c04de380f6fcfb847ff92871ff77bbd2b4b976309995cebf4781d32c",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "볼일을 마치고 돌아오던 길.\n초원 한가운데서 해가 져 버렸고\n등불도 없는 나는 어찌할 바를 몰랐다.",
      "message_index_0based": 0,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 12,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b003-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "b5f0ba8b2c7c079192b1526afc14d3d9c243b27e64fde9d339697d8e602a792d:000000_-5232139205050179575:g0:r11",
      "row_index_0based": 11,
      "serialized_row_index": 11,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "野暮用を終えた帰り道のこと。\n草原の真ん中で日が暮れてしまい、\n明かりを持っていない僕は困り果てていた。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "d9f6dc0b2c56deea195d457bc820f97dec72d77c8f17026fbf9069b05127f8f0",
